    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Explain why there is an issue with $\\cot\\theta$ being defined as $\\dfrac{1}{\\tan\\theta}$, whereas $\\sec\\theta$ and $\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta$ have no such issues in being defined as $\\dfrac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$ and $\\dfrac{1}{\\sin\\theta}$ respectively.",
